{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1339.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"11ef29d6f32e493344b4232ff641efe756d0b62645eed0896a866805ef3948f2","ja":"えっ？　でも私、いつもと同じように\nインタビューに答えただけだよ？","zh":"诶？但我只是和平时一样\n接受了采访而已哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1339.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"41d09cf67a2c8b95f63def623f8c3215ce5bb8cb5d32f245e1bc74b748a003da","ja":"杏奈たち……あの雑誌で、ギャルのカリスマ\nみたいな存在に、なってて……。","zh":"杏奈她们……在那本杂志上，变得像辣妹的领袖\n一样的人物了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1339.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"398d7f3f0877181af348ea920f41bd29d059d3310f0c07bf5b4963241d142372","ja":"やよいちゃんが……よく食べてる物、なら、\nダイエットにいいはず……って、思われたみたい。","zh":"大家好像觉得……只要是弥生经常吃的东西，\n就应该对减肥很有效果……的样子。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1339.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4ace52f7efecce617a7e7b568b415eeaddd9f10a8bcdb2946b22e9678d68866b","ja":"それでみんな、もやしをいーっぱい\n買うようになったんだ！","zh":"所以大家都买了\n超——级多的豆芽！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1339.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"651f597bf9f72af8eef965d30fbfd2c561bcc7b5546ee9c5592738810c047540","ja":"で、あちこちで売り切れてしまった、\nってことか……。","zh":"所以到处都卖光了，\n是这么回事吗……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1339.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"9c21ec6b1965d09af7282512afbd380977b0de8b73a55b601fe0aca9b06d4bf8","ja":"でも、このまま売り切れが続くと、\n困る人も出てきそうだな……。","zh":"不过，如果一直这样售罄下去，\n感觉也会有人感到为难啊……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1339.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"9c48182e62297c66393fe557739ab7204bff44199149be606191f693a15e99c5","ja":"うう……もう、私が困っちゃってます……。","zh":"呜呜……真是的，我都感到为难了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1339.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"9dbc2550c1d1856cb98c1157a85bf7d19c9282a995e340abb07d351b965ef43f","ja":"はは……まあ、真似してもらえるのは嬉しいけど、\n発言には気を付けた方がよさそうだな。","zh":"哈哈……也是，虽然被模仿挺让人高兴的，\n但以后说话还是注意一点比较好啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1339.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"cfde2247a3f7b68acabaa628babdb490ba578e3da3e2a294e9371ab23f0a7098","ja":"いろんな影響があって……\nカリスマギャルになるのも……大変、だね……。","zh":"受到了各种影响……\n要成为辣妹领袖……也很辛苦……呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
